            "detailed_description": "Prompt is a hardcore platformer.  It is minimalist, it is retro, and it is very, very hard.<br><br>Everything from the visual style to the design of every level has been coded with love, just for you.  Each level will give you a new challenge, and it will require you to complete it in a new way.<br><br>Prompt has a full level editor.  Create and share levels with your friends!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Must-have Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Double jumping!<br></li><li> Simulated gravity!<br></li><li> <span class=\"bb_strike\">Moving platform physics!</span><br></li><li> Full 1-bit color depth!<br></li><li> Extra widescreen 5:4 aspect ratio!</li></ul><br>The excellent music in Prompt was produced by Matt Simmonds.  Check out his other work at !",
